Description: Fix override_dh_installinfo crashing when nodoc skips info installation
 With nodoc in DEB_BUILD_OPTIONS, dh_installinfo does not install files into
 debian/libgcrypt20-doc/usr/share/info/. The existing guard only checks for
 the package staging directory (which dh always creates), not for the info
 subdirectory, so the subsequent `cd` fails and the build aborts.
 Tighten the guard to check the info directory directly.
Author: Harkirat S Virk <harkiratsvirk@gmail.com>
Origin: local
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-05-03
---
This patch header follows DEP-3: http://dep.debian.net/deps/dep3/
--- a/debian/rules
+++ b/debian/rules
@@ -63,7 +63,7 @@ override_dh_auto_install-arch:

 override_dh_installinfo:
 	dh_installinfo
-	if test -e debian/libgcrypt20-doc ; then \
+	if test -e debian/libgcrypt20-doc/usr/share/info ; then \
 		cd debian/libgcrypt20-doc/usr/share/info && \
 		sed -i -e 's:image src="\([^"]*.png"\):image src="/usr/share/doc/libgcrypt20-doc/html/\1:g' *.info* ; \
 	fi
